# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# earn — environment configuration (ALL OPTIONAL)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# earn works with ZERO configuration. If no wallet is provided it
# auto-generates an ephemeral, unfunded, read-only Solana keypair
# (stored 0600 in your config dir) that is sufficient for every
# read-only command: discover, track, list, show, sync, report,
# export, watch.
#
# You only need a wallet of your own if you want your discovery
# calls signed by a specific identity. earn NEVER performs funded
# or write operations, so a funded key is never required.

# Option A: raw private key (base58 string, or JSON array of 32/64 bytes).
# Mirrors the official Gibwork SDK/CLI env var name.
# GIBWORK_PRIVATE_KEY=[12,34,...]

# Option B: path to an existing Solana keypair JSON file.
# GIBWORK_KEYPAIR_PATH=/absolute/path/to/id.json

# Environment: "production" (default) or "stage".
# EARN_ENVIRONMENT=production

# Request timeout in milliseconds (default 20000).
# EARN_TIMEOUT_MS=20000

# Override where earn stores its ledger + ephemeral key.
# Defaults to a per-OS config dir (see `earn doctor`).
# EARN_HOME=/absolute/path/to/earn-home
